l focus."},{"type":"Precautions re: Children","notes":"Warning: This product is intended for healthy adults, 18 years of age or older.\r\nKeep out of reach of children."},{"type":"Precautions re: All Other","notes":"Consult a physician prior to use if you are taking any other dietary supplement. \r\nDo not exceed recommended serving. Exceeding recommended serving may cause adverse health effects. This product contains 300 mg of caffeine per serving (approximately 3 cups of coffee) and may not be suitable for individuals who are sensitive to the effects of caffeine. Too much caffeine may cause nervousness, irritability, sleeplessness, and occasional rapid heartbeat. Immediately discontinue use and consult a qualified medical professional if you experience any adverse effects."},{"type":"Precautions re: Pregnant or Nursing or Prescription Medications","notes":" Do not take this product if you are pregnant or nursing. If you have or suspect you may have a medical condition, or if you are taking any prescription or over-the-counter medications."},{"type":"Precautions re: All Other","notes":"Warning for California Residents: Consuming this product can expose you to lead which is known to the State of California to cause cancer and birth defects or other reproductive harm. For more information go to www.P65Warnings.ca.gov"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Tiktok Facebook Instagram\r\nFollow us @prosupps\r\nScan me to learn more"},{"type":"Formulation re: Other","notes":"Intense energy pre-workout\r\nEnergy\r\nFocus\r\nElectrolytes"},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"Jawbreaker\r\nNatural & artificial flavors"},{"type":"FDA Statement of Identity","notes":"Dietary Supplement"},{"type":"Formulation re: Does NOT Contain","notes":"Banned substance tested"},{"type":"Suggested/Recommended/Usage/Directions","notes":"Suggested Use: Mix 1 scoop of Mr. HYDE Nightmare with 6-8 oz of water. Consume 15-30 minutes prior to training or competition. Assess tolerance by taking 1 scoop the first time."},{"type":"Precautions re: All Other","notes":"Do not consume within 4 hours of bedtime.\r\nDo not take any other products that contain caffeine or stimulants while taking Mr. HYDE Nightmare."},{"type":"Formulation re: Other","notes":"Get ready for a tingle! Beta-Alanine has been shown to boost exercise endurance, and it may cause some tingling - it'll fade in a few minutes. Time to get to work!"},{"type":"Seals/Symbols","notes":"Made in the USA with foreign and domestic ingredients"},{"type":"Storage","notes":"Store in a cool, dry place. Content sold by weight not volume, some settling may occur. Protect from heat, light, and moisture."},{"type":"Precautions re: Allergies","notes":"Manufactured in a facility that also processes ingredients containing milk, eggs, fish, shellfish, tree nuts, peanut, wheat, sesame, and soy."},{"type":"FDA Disclaimer Statement","notes":"These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. This product is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease."},{"type":"Seals/Symbols","notes":"Informed Choice We Test - You Trust"},{"type":"Formulation re: Does NOT Contain","notes":"Banned Substance Tested"}],"claims":[{"langualCode":"P0065","langualCodeDescription":"Nutrient "},{"langualCode":"P0115","langualCodeDescription":"All Other"},{"langualCode":"P0265","langualCodeDescription":"Structure/Function"}],"events":[{"date":"2025-05-21","type":"Date entered into DSLD"}],"userGroups":[{"dailyValueTargetGroupName":"Adults and children 4 or more years of age","langualCode":"P0250","langualCodeDescription":"Adults and Children 4 years and above"}],"ingredientRows":[{"order":1,"ingredientId":297348,"description":"","notes":"","quantity":[{"servingSizeOrder":1,"servingSizeQuantity":13.3,"operator":"=","quantity":80,"unit":"mg","dailyValueTargetGroup":[{"name":"Adults and children 4 or more years of age","operator":"=","percent":3,"footnote":null}],"servingSizeUnit":"